{title: 684 - Hear Our Prayer, O Lord}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #684 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 684}
{meta: category Sentences and Responses - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Hear our prayer, O [A]Lord,
[A7]Hear [G]our [A7]prayer, O [D]Lord;
[D]Incline Thine ear [D7]to [G]us,
[Em]And [D]grant [A]us [A7]Thy [D]peace.
[G]A[D]men.
{end_of_verse}
